WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.753
Jemima swam across the pond.

2
00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:08.586
She quacked at the ducklings.

3
00:00:08.587 --> 00:00:13.387
"Follow me!" Jemima said.

4
00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:19.528
Jemima's duckling followed her.

5
00:00:19.529 --> 00:00:23.435
But Dora's ducklings did not.

6
00:00:23.436 --> 00:00:26.852
The ducklings swam in the reeds.

7
00:00:26.853 --> 00:00:35.588
The ducklings dived under lily pads.

8
00:00:35.589 --> 00:00:39.980
The ducklings played with the frogs.

9
00:00:39.981 --> 00:00:49.427
"Ugh!" Jemima said.

10
00:00:49.428 --> 00:00:55.041
At last Jemima had all the ducklings.

11
00:00:55.042 --> 00:00:57.452
She tried to count them.

12
00:00:57.453 --> 00:01:00.796
"One, two, three . . .

13
00:01:00.797 --> 00:01:03.319
No, two . . ."

14
00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:12.945
The ducklings kept swimming away!

15
00:01:12.946 --> 00:01:20.931
Finally everyone got out of the pond.

16
00:01:20.932 --> 00:01:25.959
"Whew!" Jemima said.

17
00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.782
"Hi, Jemima!" Dora called.

18
00:01:29.783 --> 00:01:33.092
She was back from the shop.

19
00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:49.881
"Thank you for watching my babies."

20
00:01:49.882 --> 00:01:52.740
Jemima shook water from her feathers.

21
00:01:52.741 --> 00:02:02.295
She flapped her wings.

22
00:02:02.296 --> 00:02:05.777
"Poor Dora," Jemima said.

23
00:02:05.778 --> 00:02:12.836
"Five ducklings is too many babies!"

24
00:02:12.837 --> 00:02:15.824
Jemima waddled away.

25
00:02:15.825 --> 00:02:24.441
And one perfect duckling followed.

